00:06:10.440 --> 00:06:14.720
When I begin Hang Gliding this it was very beginning of hang

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:17.960
glider. So this hang glider was never

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:20.480
able to do any cross country flying.

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:23.400
You take off landing with the Rogallo.

00:06:23.720 --> 00:06:28.720
I don't know if you know that just very basic hang glider and

00:06:28.720 --> 00:06:33.120
beginning of hang glider. So you just take off and go land

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:36.200
in one minute. But that was big pleasure.

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:42.880
And then when paragliding start, there's not many place to fly in

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:47.080
Korea because the old mountains was no road and things like

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:50.720
this. But we found a new place and

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:54.160
