00:06:57.280 --> 00:07:00.760
flying site to the City Hall or local government.

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:04.400
And then also in the very beginning of parallel, I think I

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:08.000
was young and I had strong passions.

00:07:08.480 --> 00:07:13.920
I had a big school, yeah. So I think that was, I don't

00:07:13.920 --> 00:07:20.400
