00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:25.760
and then teaching the peoples and like they have no idea.

00:07:25.760 --> 00:07:29.520
So I have a lot of experience from Hang Gliding.

00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:32.520
So I know what you have to do in the air.

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:36.880
So when paragliding was begun, I knew the air.

00:07:36.880 --> 00:07:44.400
I knew how to thermaling but by then actually the paraglider was

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:49.000
