00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:59.480
developed and then start to make a distance flying kind of thing.

00:07:59.480 --> 00:08:06.360
So why I was fully concentrated paragliding in Korea, was in

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:08.440
Korea and there's not many place to land.

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:11.600
