00:08:45.720 --> 00:08:50.680
So I'm quite happy and I did a quite a big job in Korea.

00:08:51.480 --> 00:08:53.880
That's so nice to hear that you basically mentored.

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:57.680
Yeah, yeah, yeah. Which is reaping the benefits

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:01.880
